      ],
      "url": "https://cube001.atlassian.net/browse/CPN-610",
      "panels": [
        {
          "type": "info",
          "text": "28/09/26 All CUBE repos have been migrated to GHE and pipelines relinked to use GHE. Kodex migration has been completed. The majority of Acin repos have been migrated, 60 are outstanding, pipeline migration is to be completed. 4CRisk repos have been migrated, there were post migration issues which are being resolved. The Golden Pipeline and AI Skills have been created documented. Engineering Managers are being engaged to work on pipeline migration with support from the team. Feedback on the Golden Pipeline/skills is being reviewed and changes/enhancements made if required and prioritised. Blocking of Critical security vulnerabilities was enabled 16/09 with some security exceptions required. Blocking of High security vulnerabilities is planned for 08/10."
        }
      ]
